# tic tac toe game

## how to run

```bach
    #download then executable file and double click
    #in realse section 

    #or run clone with git if you like to contrubute or #build the executable with your self.

    #clone repos
    git clone repos_adress# copy it form github repos.
    
    #then the whole project will be in you laptop.

    git pull # for updates.
```

## explanation about game

this is typical x o game so there is nothing new ,
its work on console interface whit two modes:

- solo:
  you play with ai with diffucilties level.
  more you chose harder bot you will face stronger bot
  the last bot use **minimax algorithme** so good luck to beat him.
- multiplayer:
    this mode is where you play with your friend in same place so have fun .

you just need to chosse your mark and start play then if the one how one will print it and show the border with colored winning line.

# how to use or test the game

you can run the game form desktop launcher by run does command.

```bach
    #this will run install.sh that create required set up
    #run chmod +x install.sh to make it executable
    make install

    #this is unistall the app entierly 
    #make sure that you run chmod+x unistall.sh
    make unistall 
```